                                                "sense_id": "746d8aef-c38f-387a-910c-6c4071a7d8c3",
                                                "text": "For the first time, the arrests broadened beyond payments to police, with a Ministry of Defence employee and a member of the Armed forces held by police before also being bailed to a date in May."
